{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45700","headline":"施万病丸 · 贯休","name":"施万病丸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我闻昔有海上翁，须眉皎白尘土中。\n葫芦盛药行如风，病者与药皆惺憁。\n药王药上亲兄弟，救人急於己诸体。\n玉毫调御偏赞扬，金轮释梵咸归礼。\n贤守运心亦相似，不吝亲亲拘子子。\n曾闻古德有深言，由来大士皆如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45700.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45700","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}